{"id":"464a8f725b8f5d60","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-nonstationary-complement.md","title":"Nonstationary Complement Theorem","display":"thm-nonstationary-complement — Nonstationary Complement Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-nonstationary-complement","aliases":["58-thm-nonstationary-complement"],"display":"thm-nonstationary-complement — Nonstationary Complement Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-nonstationary-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-nonstationary-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-nonstationary-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nonstationary-complement — Nonstationary Complement Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09aa431166d68ab6\" href=\"?note=09aa431166d68ab6\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-nonstationary-ideal.md\">../batch17/58-df-nonstationary-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa=\\{S\\subseteq\\kappa:\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa=\\{S\\subseteq\\kappa:\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonstationary\\text{-}complement} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow S\\notin\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonstationary\\text{-}complement} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\to\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow S\\notin\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The complement is taken inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>, not inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-nonstationary-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"09aa431166d68ab6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-nonstationary-ideal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa=\\{S\\subseteq\\kappa:\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nonstationary\\text{-}complement} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\to\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow S\\notin\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1007,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-nonstationary-complement.md|58-thm-nonstationary-complement]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["0fbfc19800246e77","b802c3dd76418d95","09aa431166d68ab6"]}